<title>HONG KONG: CITIC Pacific 1996 net HK$6.86 bln.</title>
<headline>CITIC Pacific 1996 net HK$6.86 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 322.3    vs  152.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  45.0     vs  55.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	3,298    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			  6,860.0  vs  3,073.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   12,756   vs  10,836.0</p>
<p>    Company name	     CITIC Pacific Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		June 3-10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 June 25</p>
<p>NOTE - CITIC Pacific engages in investment holding, airline operation, motor distribution and servicing, trading, warehousing and distribution, property investment and telecommunications.</p>
<p>Exceptional item represents profit on disposal of 3.85 percent interest in Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd and 17.66 percent interest in Hong Kong Dragon Airlines Ltd.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 91.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 16.5 cents and special dividend of 30 cents announced earlier) vs 55 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
